# API Tests für Wishling
# Verwendung: REST Client Extension in VS Code
# Drücken Sie "Send Request" über jeder Anfrage

@baseUrl = https://wishling.ddev.site

### Test 1: API Controller Index
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 2: API Controller getData mit Parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data/123
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 3: Test API Controller
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test/
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 4: Wishlist API Index
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 5: Alle Wishlists abrufen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 6: Neue Wishlist erstellen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Wishlist",
    "description": "Eine Test-Wunschliste"
}

### Test 7: Wishlist Details abrufen (Hash ersetzen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/YOUR_WISHLIST_HASH
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 8: Wunsch erstellen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/YOUR_WISHLIST_HASH/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Wunsch",
    "description": "Ein Testwunsch",
    "url": "https://example.com",
    "price": "29.99"
}

### Test 9: CORS Preflight Test
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists
Content-Type: application/json
